WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.012
Use the checkpoint to choose the stronger evaluation practice.

00:00:04.012 --> 00:00:09.707
A fair comparison should hold the test set, settings, and rubric constant.

00:00:09.707 --> 00:00:12.742
Answer the question on the screen first.

00:00:12.742 --> 00:00:19.841
The larger model or the most impressive single response is not automatically the better application choice.
